  data: {
    LLM: "In Suicide, if you have the Ace of Spades, you CANNOT bid Nil. Force your partner to bid Nil. In Mirrors, play aggressively with your Spades to make your bid, since everyone knows everyone's Spade count partially.\n\nWhiz Strategy: If you have 3 small Spades (2, 3, 4), bidding 3 is risky. Maybe bid Nil and hope to discard them on void suits? No, usually you must bid your Spade COUNT. So 3. You must take tricks with them.\n\nForcing Bags in Mirrors: Since bids are fixed, you can force opponents to take bags by leading suits they are long in but have low cards.",
